---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: saffron_q6"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: A.NumberSid ASC NULLS LAST, A.Capability ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   SubqueryAlias: A                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     TableScan: number_info_with_cap projection=[DateCreated, DateUpdated, AccountSid, NumberPoolSid, NumberSid, MaxRate, NumberDid, NumberType, SupportedDestRegion, NumberRegion, CurrentRate, IsAvailable, ProviderSid, AreaCodeRegion, AvailableForNumberSelection, Capability], full_filters=[number_info_with_cap.AccountSid = LargeUtf8("AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066"), number_info_with_cap.NumberPoolSid = LargeUtf8("NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9"), number_info_with_cap.NumberRegion = LargeUtf8("US"), number_info_with_cap.NumberType = LargeUtf8("lc"), number_info_with_cap.MaxRate = Int32(20), number_info_with_cap.NumberSid != LargeUtf8("PN00000000000000000000000000000099"), number_info_with_cap.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(1) OR number_info_with_cap.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(0), number_info_with_cap.Capability = LargeUtf8("sms")]                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=1), expr=[NumberSid@4 ASC NULLS LAST, Capability@15 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |   SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         DuckSqlExec sql=WITH _intermediate_materialize AS MATERIALIZED (SELECT "AccountSid", "AreaCodeRegion", "AvailableForNumberSelection", "Capability", "CurrentRate", "DateCreated", "DateUpdated", "IsAvailable", "MaxRate", "NumberDid", "NumberPoolSid", "NumberRegion", "NumberSid", "NumberType", "ProviderSid", "SupportedDestRegion" FROM "expr0=25/number_info_with_cap" WHERE "AccountSid" = 'AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066' AND "NumberPoolSid" = 'NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9') SELECT "DateCreated", "DateUpdated", "AccountSid", "NumberPoolSid", "NumberSid", "MaxRate", "NumberDid", "NumberType", "SupportedDestRegion", "NumberRegion", "CurrentRate", "IsAvailable", "ProviderSid", "AreaCodeRegion", "AvailableForNumberSelection", "Capability" FROM _intermediate_materialize WHERE (true) AND (true) AND ("NumberRegion" = 'US') AND ("NumberType" = 'lc') AND ("MaxRate" = 20) AND ("NumberSid" <> 'PN00000000000000000000000000000099') AND (("AvailableForNumberSelection" = 1) OR ("AvailableForNumberSelection" = 0)) AND ("Capability" = 'sms') |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
